  "description": "Cross-platform Firebase Auth service for .NET (MAUI, Blazor, Console, etc.). Supports login, registration, password reset, auto token refresh, unregister (account deletion), password change, email change flow, and typed error mapping including refresh token errors.",
  "id": "FirebaseAuth.NET",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-15T11:01:28.013Z",
